{"content":"{\"chapter_contract_id\":\"contract:v2-n-9-1:v2\",\"node_id\":\"v2_n_9_1\",\"schema_version\":\"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\"known_evidence_ids\":[\"evidence:source:a0ccda919261d50457b464263a4c2a8d0c5d67ffec9baf8ff110173c85f43355\",\"evidence:source:2e8603b57f20519f04494375af65e08e6a5fb34d72223b6debf0a5439685ee52\",\"evidence:source:f51011f85a2bea698ff3b96318145bf9359cf91d77a6713ac8c773748b59932c\"],\"blocks\":[{\"block_id\":\"block:paragraph:framework-scope\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"本节应承接父节点“疗效评估”的章首评估框架，界定疗效终点、测量口径及其与已确认研究目的和估计目标的追溯关系。本节疗效评估范围为：主要疗效目的对应的主要终点，以及已列出的关键次要终点候选；安全性终点不在本节疗效终点范围内。安全性随访应至第 56 周，并包括末次给药后 4 周的安全性访视。【待补充：疗效评估框架的完整范围界定（包括与安全性评估、统计分析章节的边界）：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。\",\"evidence_refs\":[\"evidence:source:a0ccda919261d50457b464263a4c2a8d0c5d67ffec9baf8ff110173c85f43355\"],\"source_locator\":\"word/document.xml/body/10:p\"},{\"block_id\":\"block:paragraph:primary-objective-endpoint\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"主要疗效目的为：在经高分辨率计算机断层扫描（HRCT）或肺活检确诊特发性肺纤维化（IPF）的成人试验参与者中，评估 AD-101 100 mg 每日一次（qd）和 200 mg qd 对比安慰剂，至第 52 周用力肺活量（FVC）较基线绝对变化值（mL）的疗效；采用固定序列检验：先 AD-101 200 mg qd 对比安慰剂，达到统计学显著后再检验 AD-101 100 mg qd 对比安慰剂。主要终点为：第 52 周 FVC 较基线绝对变化值（mL）。主要终点应直接回链上述主要目的及主要估计目标。\",\"evidence_refs\":[\"evidence:source:2e8603b57f20519f04494375af65e08e6a5fb34d72223b6debf0a5439685ee52\"],\"source_locator\":\"word/document.xml/body/6:p\"},{\"block_id\":\"block:paragraph:measurement-gaps\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"主要终点的测量口径应项目化定义。【待补充：主要终点（第 52 周 FVC 较基线绝对变化值，mL）的测量方法、派生规则与评估工具：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。【待补充：用于主要终点和关键次要终点评估的命名量表/仪器及其版本：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。【待补充：评估者角色、资质与培训要求：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。【待补充：各疗效终点的评估时点与窗口，需与已接受的研究流程表一致：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。\",\"evidence_refs\":[\"evidence:source:2e8603b57f20519f04494375af65e08e6a5fb34d72223b6debf0a5439685ee52\"],\"source_locator\":\"word/document.xml/body/6:p\"},{\"block_id\":\"block:paragraph:secondary-endpoints\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"关键次要终点候选包括：第 52 周 FVC 占预计值百分比变化；6 分钟步行距离变化；无进展生存期（疾病进展或死亡）；圣乔治呼吸问卷（SGRQ）总分变化。上述候选待下游人审确认。【待补充：关键次要终点对应的次要目的及其估计目标：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。\",\"evidence_refs\":[\"evidence:source:f51011f85a2bea698ff3b96318145bf9359cf91d77a6713ac8c773748b59932c\"],\"source_locator\":\"word/document.xml/body/7:p\"},{\"block_id\":\"block:table:endpoint-mapping\",\"kind\":\"table\",\"evidence_refs\":[\"evidence:source:2e8603b57f20519f04494375af65e08e6a5fb34d72223b6debf0a5439685ee52\",\"evidence:source:f51011f85a2bea698ff3b96318145bf9359cf91d77a6713ac8c773748b59932c\"],\"table\":{\"table_id\":\"efficacy:table:endpoint-mapping\",\"block_id\":\"efficacy:table:endpoint-mapping\",\"title\":\"终点映射表\",\"domain\":\"objectives_endpoints\",\"role\":\"body_content\",\"header_row_count\":1,\"review_state\":\"ai_draft\",\"source_locator\":\"word/document.xml/body/6:p; word/document.xml/body/7:p\",\"columns\":[{\"column_id\":\"efficacy:col:objective\",\"label\":\"研究目的\",\"order\":0,\"semantic_role\":\"objective\"},{\"column_id\":\"efficacy:col:endpoint\",\"label\":\"疗效终点\",\"order\":1,\"semantic_role\":\"endpoint\"},{\"column_id\":\"efficacy:col:estimand\",\"label\":\"估计目标\",\"order\":2,\"semantic_role\":\"estimand\"}],\"rows\":[{\"row_id\":\"efficacy:row:primary\",\"order\":0,\"label\":\"主要终点\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"efficacy:cell:objective\",\"row_id\":\"efficacy:row:primary\",\"column_id\":\"efficacy:col:objective\",\"text\":\"在经 HRCT 或肺活检确诊 IPF 的成人试验参与者中，评估 AD-101 100 mg qd 和 200 mg qd 对比安慰剂，至第 52 周 FVC 较基线绝对变化值（mL）的疗效；采用固定序列检验：先 AD-101 200 mg qd 对比安慰剂，达到统计学显著后再检验 AD-101 100 mg qd 对比安慰剂。\",\"provenance_lineage\":[\"evidence:source:2e8603b57f20519f04494375af65e08e6a5fb34d72223b6debf0a5439685ee52\"],\"source_locator\":\"word/document.xml/body/6:p\"},{\"cell_id\":\"efficacy:cell:endpoint\",\"row_id\":\"efficacy:row:primary\",\"column_id\":\"efficacy:col:endpoint\",\"text\":\"第 52 周 FVC 较基线绝对变化值（mL）。\",\"provenance_lineage\":[\"evidence:source:2e8603b57f20519f04494375af65e08e6a5fb34d72223b6debf0a5439685ee52\"],\"source_locator\":\"word/document.xml/body/6:p\"},{\"cell_id\":\"efficacy: